00:26:23.033 --> 00:26:24.200
Kapan terakhir kali dia ngerjain kamu?

00:26:27.400 --> 00:26:33.500
Enggak kok. Aku lebih jago, ya?

00:27:16.533 --> 00:27:17.866
Kencang banget.

00:27:23.866 --> 00:27:27.200
Sumpah.

00:27:53.666 --> 00:27:55.500
Kalau terlalu kencang, gawat tahu.

00:28:09.466 --> 00:28:12.066
Bisa-bisa aku malah klimaks.

00:28:20.533 --> 00:28:22.000
Jangan klimaks dulu.

00:28:42.033 --> 00:28:43.566
Makanya kubilang kalau kencang itu gawat.

00:29:05.600 --> 00:29:06.600
Makin kencang.

00:29:17.100 --> 00:29:18.100
Makin kencang.

00:29:22.600 --> 00:29:30.166
Makin kencang nih.

00:29:35.466 --> 00:29:36.633
Belum boleh.

00:29:44.733 --> 00:30:03.600
Sensei, aku udah enggak tahan. Sensei, ayo kita lakukan?

00:30:26.233 --> 00:31:03.000
Beneran enggak tahan. Aku sama Asu-san, jagoan mana?

00:31:03.000 --> 00:31:04.000
Sakit.

00:31:08.233 --> 00:31:09.433
Aku pengen melakukannya dengan Sensei.

00:31:14.733 --> 00:31:17.700
Keras banget, aneh rasanya.

00:31:18.766 --> 00:31:19.766
Hebat.

00:31:29.700 --> 00:31:30.700
Su

00:31:48.733 --> 00:31:49.000
ka?

00:31:49.333 --> 00:31:50.333
Su
ka.

00:31:55.800 --> 00:31:58.000
Aku juga suka Sensei.

00:32:02.933 --> 00:32:05.133
Buat lebih kencang lagi.

00:32:27.700 --> 00:32:28.700
Jangan.

00:32:41.700 --> 00:32:42.833
Jangan.

00:34:22.933 --> 00:34:24.133
Lagi.

00:34:28.200 --> 00:34:41.100
Rasanya aneh banget. Beneran aneh, ya?

00:34:41.800 --> 00:34:44.200
Pinggulmu gerak banget. Kamu tidak apa-apa?

00:34:48.633 --> 00:34:50.066
Disentuh di situ, gawat.

00:34:56.766 --> 00:34:58.233
Rasanya aneh.

00:35:03.200 --> 00:35:04.233
Suaranya kencang banget.

00:35:05.266 --> 00:35:06.766
Aneh.

00:35:32.900 --> 00:35:34.666
Panas.

00:35:35.466 --> 00:35:36.466
Panas.

00:35:38.666 --> 00:35:40.866
Panas.

00:36:08.366 --> 00:36:10.900
Panas.

00:37:21.000 --> 00:37:23.200
Sensei, lakukan itu.

00:37:23.600 --> 00:37:23.866
Itu?

00:37:24.433 --> 00:37:25.866
Mau aku lakuin itu?

00:37:26.633 --> 00:37:28.333
Pegang yang erat.

00:37:37.400 --> 00:37:38.400
Ini?

00:38:56.766 --> 00:38:59.233
Sensei, hebat. Udah cukup?

00:39:00.566 --> 00:39:01.766
Lebih baik kamu lega.

00:39:03.400 --> 00:39:06.433
Lebih baik kamu lega. Udah cukup?

00:39:10.500 --> 00:39:11.500
Udah lega?

00:39:11.633 --> 00:40:14.600
Udah lega. Menjijikkan. Udah cukup?

00:40:23.333 --> 00:40:24.666
Hm. Udah cukup?

00:41:58.433 --> 00:41:59.433
Rasanya enak.

00:42:11.100 --> 00:42:12.100
Hebat.

00:42:16.000 --> 00:42:18.166
Menjijikkan.

00:42:18.433 --> 00:42:19.866
Menjijikkan.

00:42:36.600 --> 00:42:38.600
Hebat, nutup terus ya.

00:42:40.233 --> 00:42:41.700
Menjijikkan.

00:42:42.333 --> 00:42:43.700
Hebat, Sensei juga menjijikkan.

00:42:44.800 --> 00:42:45.333
Suka?

