Hebat, ya kan.

00:44:44.000 --> 00:44:46.466
Tapi, sepertinya bisa.

00:44:46.766 --> 00:44:48.266
Enak.

00:44:48.466 --> 00:44:48.866
Suka?

00:44:49.100 --> 00:44:49.366
Sensei.

00:44:49.566 --> 00:44:50.566
Hm, suka.

00:44:55.800 --> 00:44:56.800
Panas.

00:45:47.500 --> 00:45:49.666
Padahal aku bilang keluarkan di dalam.

00:45:51.133 --> 00:45:52.433
