Ayo ke kasur.

00:56:41.033 --> 00:56:42.033
Oh.

00:56:47.600 --> 00:56:48.800
Bisa gawat kalau Ayah bangun.

00:56:53.266 --> 00:56:55.700
Sensei, dari tadi keras terus. Memikirkan apa?

00:57:05.700 --> 00:57:06.766
