00:58:25.433 --> 00:58:27.466
Suka

00:59:38.033 --> 00:59:39.500
Sensei.
Perutku bunyi.

00:59:51.566 --> 00:59:52.566
Perutku

01:00:25.600 --> 01:00:46.733
bunyi. Sini ke belakang. Kelihatan?

01:00:48.133 --> 01:00:49.133
Lagi dong.

